% $Log$
% Revision 1.6  1997/08/07 20:04:42  dstotler
% Move the Marlowe data from a nonuniform to uniform (log) energy grid.
% Output files were hard-wired to be written into degas2/data;
% change this to local directory. Change spacing of energy_out
% in marlowe data to 'log'. Remove indep_var usage.
% Switch cosspec -> cosine in refl.dat section to make the reflection
% model analogous to the one in original DEGAS.
%
% Revision 1.5  1996/05/24 18:54:35  dstotler
% Add routines to write simple, generic data files. Finalize and clean
% up treatment of Bateman and refl-Ruzic data.
%
% Revision 1.4  1996/03/01 20:21:15  dstotler
% Switch from including all header files to explicit including only the
% needed ones.
%
% Revision 1.3  1995/07/14 13:20:29  karney
% Coding for strata added.
% Switch \Wtitle to \Title.
% Update to use standard etags.
%
% Revision 1.2  1995/06/16 18:21:01  dstotler
% Extend to treat Bateman-format reflection data (tables up to rank 5).
%
